# tally 2.2.1 P31 (L §8 l.2217, L §4.4 l.671), the first engine review's B4: a refusal none of whose reads meets a value
# under a window's hole is given on every day and stands. The scenario's px on a window across its from, the base's bad
# refused (RUN-DIV) on 05-10: b0531 and explain are that refusal, as every pin; b0509, before it, stays the hole. tally
# 2.2 printed the window's hole.
=== ot_base.tally
model otb
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input zero: num
input w: date
input d_bad: date
move bad: transfers
  on d_bad
  leg cash from konto to world amount round(amt / zero, minor(PLN), half-up)
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  zero = 0 "s"
  d_bad = 2026-05-10 "s"
  w = window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03) "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
ask base: bal(konto, 2026-05-31)
=== ot_sc.tally
scenario sc over otb
  tally 2
  from 2026-05-01
move px: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt
ask b0509: bal(konto, 2026-05-09) in sc
ask b0531: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc
ask p0429: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-04-29
ask p0501: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-05-01
ask p0503: bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-05-03
ask ex: explain bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc
=== expect
b0509: ?"date within window(2026-04-28, 2026-05-03) not precise enough for a balance" (px)
  unknown day: w
  world: sc
  cut 2026-06-10
b0531: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  world: sc
  cut 2026-06-10
base: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  cut 2026-06-10
ex: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  world: sc
  cut 2026-06-10
p0429: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  pinned: w = 2026-04-29
  world: sc
  left out: px, 1 instances, first 2026-04-29
  cut 2026-06-10
p0501: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  pinned: w = 2026-05-01
  world: sc
  unfulfilled: px
  cut 2026-06-10
p0503: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  pinned: w = 2026-05-03
  world: sc
  unfulfilled: px
  cut 2026-06-10
